WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.720
Is TikTok still worth it? Well, I just

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:07.240
spent the last 30 days posting every

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:08.880
single day on TikTok, so let's talk

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:11.080
about it. The reason I did this was a

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:13.120
few different things. One is that I love

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:14.960
posting content about being a mom. While

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:17.040
I do have my vlog channel, I was really

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:18.680
curious about short-form content and how

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.520
it could potentially grow at a much

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:22.400
faster rate compared to my YouTube

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:24.520
channel. Learn what happens if I am

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.080
actually consistent on that platform and

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:27.960
see how long it actually takes to get

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.240
monetized, which I'll put an asterisk by

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.440
that because there's a few different

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:31.680
ways that you can get monetized on

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.320
TikTok and we'll talk about that a

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:35.480
little bit later. So, first off, let's

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:37.400
talk about what exactly I did. My

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:39.320
specific goal within this challenge for

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.400
myself was to post one thing every

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:43.360
single day. This could be either like

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:45.320
carousels that TikTok lets you do or it

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:47.080
could be videos rather than a TikTok

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:48.560
story. I was allowed to post more than

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:50.280
one per day, but I just wanted to make

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:52.160
that like my minimum goal. Two different

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:53.520
things that I wanted to look at. One was

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:55.560
doing a little bit more structured

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:57.840
content, so things like my morning

00:00:55.560 --> 00:01:00.000
routine, um mini vlog, what's in my

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:02.240
diaper bag, longer-form, short-form

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.640
content that I created. And then I also

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:06.200
experimented with more like viral trendy

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:07.560
type of posts. And then the last thing

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:09.560
that I wanted to mention as far as what

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:11.400
I did was the time that I actually spent

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:14.720
doing this every single day. So, I'll be

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:16.600
honest, I'll be like breastfeeding my

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:18.240
newborn and I'll be scrolling through

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:20.080
TikTok finding kind of ideas and

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:21.840
inspiration from other people's posts.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:23.640
Because I'm doing that already, that

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:25.440
makes it a lot easier for me to quickly

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:26.880
like film different pieces of content.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:29.720
So, I actually found that most days I

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:32.520
was really only spending maybe like 30

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:34.480
to 60 minutes actually working on my

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:36.000
TikTok videos. So, per day was actually

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:37.840
pretty low. So, now that you have kind

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.880
of a picture of what I actually did and

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:42.000
what I was really focused on, let's talk

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:44.120
about my results and how I actually grew

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:47.200
during that 30-day period. So, today as

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:49.840
I'm filming this, I am at 2,250

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:51.720
followers on TikTok, which is just about

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:53.240
a little over 200 followers gained

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:56.440
during this period. So, I'm going to

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:59.040
head over to my analytics on TikTok and

00:01:56.440 --> 00:02:01.200
kind of show you exact details of what

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:03.520
has happened, how I've grown, etc. So,

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.840
I'm going over to my analytics and then

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:06.880
um I'm going to do custom since it was

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:09.479
like random days. I started this on

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:12.400
March 8th and we'll go through April

00:02:09.479 --> 00:02:15.040
8th. So, 32 days or one full month. So,

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:18.200
post views I got 982,000

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:23.080
post views, profile visits um 3,200,

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:26.040
likes 49,000 likes, 535 comments, 4,800

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:27.320
shares, and I've made $0 because I'm not

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:29.520
part of the

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:31.760
creator rewards program yet. Majority of

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:34.560
my traffic was from the for you page. If

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:36.160
I head over to content, so I will say I

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:38.800
posted a video, you can see it that I

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:40.959
posted it on January 31st. So, this was

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:42.720
like more than a month before I started

00:02:40.959 --> 00:02:44.480
this challenge. I posted this video that

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:48.800
like went viral.

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:50.840
Um so, of that 950,000 views, 500,000 of

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:53.000
that was from this viral video still

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:54.720
getting views. So, that is worth

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:57.840
mentioning, but that still means I got

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:59.200
like 450,000 views from other videos.

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:01.239
So, you can kind of see in here

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:04.160
different videos that I posted that got

00:03:01.239 --> 00:03:07.600
quite a few views, 90,000 views, 86,000

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:09.360
views, 31,000, 25,000, 17,000, and so on

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:12.360
and so on. If we scroll over to

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:14.920
followers again, 202 followers gained.

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:16.600
So, aside from my viral video, my video

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:18.320
that got the most amount of views, it

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:20.239
currently has almost 100,000 views as

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:22.800
I'm filming this and it was a video that

00:03:20.239 --> 00:03:24.560
I shared things that don't bother me as

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.720
a second time mom that would have sent

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:29.000
me into a coma as a first time mom. And

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:31.040
again, I was really trying to focus on

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.400
content that I felt like other moms

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:34.120
would resonate with, things that are

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:35.600
like kind of like funny and relatable.

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:37.120
And those are my videos that performed

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:39.840
the best. I have another video that got

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:42.600
like 87,000 views. Again, it was same

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:44.200
type of lens of relatable mom content.

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:46.280
And then of course I had some other ones

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:48.480
that didn't perform quite as well. I did

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:49.880
a mini vlog where we went up to, you

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:51.640
know, the local mountain by us and

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:54.120
showed our time there and it only has

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:56.280
like 300 views. So, I definitely have

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:57.800
found during this time posting that

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:59.960
content that's like relatable, a little

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:01.680
bit more trendy is what worked really

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:03.560
well for me from the perspective of

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:06.200
getting a lot of views. So, let's talk

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:08.400
about a few valuable lessons that I

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:10.640
really learned from my experiment doing

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:12.880
this. The first thing is that posting

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:15.080
every single day, just simply posting,

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:16.680
is not going to guarantee growth. What

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:19.760
is going to help you actually grow is

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:21.519
posting content that is high quality,

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:24.240
that is relatable, and that people can

00:04:21.519 --> 00:04:26.280
actually find useful. At least for me,

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:28.120
like the videos that grow are videos

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:30.000
that either get saved because they're

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:32.320
useful information or they get shared

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:34.600
because they're like funny in some way.

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:36.200
I also think it's important to kind of

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:38.919
weigh the pros and cons of burnout

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:40.640
within TikTok. For me, creating this

00:04:38.919 --> 00:04:42.680
challenge for myself and posting every

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:45.640
single day, it was really important for

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:47.440
me to create videos that were going to

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:49.480
be quick and easy for me to create

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:51.160
rather than spending, you know, hours

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:53.080
filming and hours editing a TikTok

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:54.800
video. At least in this season of life

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:57.480
that I'm currently in, I needed to

00:04:54.800 --> 00:05:00.000
create content that I could film, edit,

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:01.960
and post within the span of like an hour

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.280
tops. So, it was really important for me

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:06.200
to find that like quick and easy

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:07.960
low-hanging fruit that fit well within

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:10.120
my niche. I did create some of those

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:11.360
more lengthy vlog-style videos, and I

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.960
think that there's definitely value in

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:15.600
some of those longer videos for other

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:17.200
reasons, but if you're just looking for

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:19.120
kind of like that more explosive growth

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:20.560
where you're getting a lot of views and

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:22.440
having that view count and like gaining

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:25.440
followers quickly, I think it's a little

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:26.600
bit more impactful to be posting and

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:28.480
creating content that's a little bit

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:30.200
more focused on like the virality

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:32.760
aspect, like being relatable, being

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:34.880
funny, content that's like shareable. I

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:36.800
don't need to recreate the wheel. If I

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:39.280
found something that worked well for my

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:41.240
TikTok page, I would create a similar

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:42.680
video again like 2 weeks later. For

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:44.200
example, I made one video where I

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:46.400
shared, actually it wasn't a video, it

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:48.280
was a carousel images where I shared

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:49.760
what my toddler ate that day because she

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:51.720
doesn't eat very much right now. She's

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:54.560
very picky. She'll have like a few bites

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:56.200
of things here and there. And that video

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:58.640
did like pretty well for me. I think the

00:05:56.200 --> 00:06:00.720
first time I posted that concept, I got

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:02.360
maybe like 12,000 views, which was

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:03.360
pretty good for me. Then a few weeks

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.880
later, I was like, you know, what? I

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:06.560
might as well create something similar

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:09.080
to that again, because people obviously

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:11.720
liked it. And the second time I made it,

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:13.200
it got like 27,000 views. Like almost

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:15.000
double what I made the first time. I got

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:16.600
tons of comments of other moms being

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.880
like, this is relatable. This is the

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:20.120
content that I needed to see. Like I've

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:21.360
been feeling like such a bad mom. This

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:23.120
makes me feel so much better, blah,

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:24.560
blah, blah. But the key takeaway here

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:26.080
was that I don't need to like reinvent

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:27.280
the wheel for every single video.

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:29.040
There's always ways that you can take

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:30.919
something that worked for you one time

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:33.840
and tweak it slightly to make another

00:06:30.919 --> 00:06:35.640
similar video and make your life even

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:37.880
easier. And then lastly, I would say

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:39.760
like hooks and pacing are super, super

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:41.800
important, especially on TikTok. If you

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:43.800
haven't captured the person's attention

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:45.760
within the first like two seconds, I

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:48.120
would say, they're probably scrolling.

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:49.919
So, think of ways that you can captivate

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:51.720
people's attention within literally the

00:06:49.919 --> 00:06:53.760
first like two seconds of your video.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:55.919
So, I'm actually going to continue

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:57.720
forward this challenge for myself. It is

00:06:55.919 --> 00:07:00.040
definitely a challenge, because I am,

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:02.120
you know, a busy stay-at-home mom of two

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:03.600
under two. But I feel like it was worth

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:06.000
it. So, a few things I'm going to be

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:08.480
trying to do differently for the next 30

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:10.440
days are pre-planning or pre-filming as

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:12.640
much content as I can, also known as

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:14.720
like batching content. So, if I'm like

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:16.120
on a creative roll one day, I'm just

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:17.640
going to try and film a few different

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:20.120
things. Same thing goes for editing,

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:22.000
like leveraging the time that I do have

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:23.800
to edit those TikTok videos. A lot of

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.000
times, I do mindless things while I'm

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:26.560
nursing or maybe like later in the

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:28.040
evenings after the kids go to bed, I

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:30.280
want to like zone out. Those are good

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:32.360
little pockets of time to focus on

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:35.000
editing. I am going to continue to

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:36.520
double down on the video styles and

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.480
topics that worked well for me. Like I'm

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:39.919
definitely going to keep making those

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:42.200
what my toddler ate today type of

00:07:39.919 --> 00:07:44.520
carousel photos. If I see any other

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:46.080
videos as I'm scrolling that performed

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:47.600
well and I feel like fit well within my

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:49.600
niche I could recreate or create

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:52.600
something similar, I'm definitely going

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:54.560
to save those and find ways to recreate

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:57.080
those as well. So, all of that to say, I

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:59.800
do think starting a TikTok page right

00:07:57.080 --> 00:08:01.640
now and beginning in 2026 is absolutely

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:03.920
still worth it. I obviously have not yet

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:06.200
been monetized, but I do hope that that

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:07.840
is coming soon. I do know in order to be

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:10.440
monetized on TikTok you have to have at

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:12.880
least 10,000 followers and have to have

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:15.480
a video that has over 100,000 views

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:17.240
within the last 30 days. So, I

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:19.120
definitely have a ways to go to get to

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:20.360
that monetization requirements, but of

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:22.800
course there's other ways that you can

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:24.680
be monetized on TikTok same as YouTube

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:25.760
maybe through brand partnerships or

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:27.960
start leveraging maybe affiliate

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:29.640
marketing on my TikTok page sooner. But,

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:31.680
that is it. I just wanted to create this

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:33.320
video and share my experience posting on

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:35.280
TikTok every day for the last 30 days.

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:36.479
So, if you found this video interesting

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.680
and useful, make sure you give it a

00:08:36.479 --> 00:08:39.200
thumbs up. If you like hearing about

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:41.039
ways to make money online especially as

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:42.880
a busy mom, then make sure you hit that

00:08:41.039 --> 00:08:44.320
subscribe button. Thank you so much for

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:47.120
watching today's video and I will catch

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:47.120
you in the next one.

